  ('Grey Soul Coffee', '1615 West Giri (Light-Med)', 'Grey Soul Coffee', 'India', 'West Giri Hills, Chikmagalur, Karnataka', 'Krishnagiri Estate', '1,615 metres (approx.)', 'Chandragiri', NULL, 'Light', 'Fresh watermelon, orange liqueur and a tea-like hibiscus finish. Dry aroma: Red Berries & Jackfruit. Wet aroma: Red Apples & Orange. Fruit-forward & expressive with a dense, syrupy texture and rounded body.', '[{"weightGrams":200,"priceINR":799,"label":"200 GMS"}]'::jsonb, 'Sold out', 'https://greysoul.coffee/products/1615-light-med-roast', 200, 'scraped'),
