  ('Grey Soul Coffee', 'THE YELLOW LOT', 'Grey Soul Coffee', 'India', 'Chikmagalur', 'Ratnagiri Estate', '4450 Feet', 'SL9', 'Anaerobic Fermented Naturals, hot washed followed by a rapid cold wash & eventually tumble mechanical dried at the farm', 'Medium', 'Dry Aroma: Ripe Red berries. Wet Aroma: Jackfruit, Dates & milk chocolate. Cup Profile: Banana, Deep Date Sweetness along with milk chocolate and subtropical fruit finish. Deeply sweet cup, Crema Rich & Heavy Bodied with Lingering aftertaste & balanced acidity.', '[{"weightGrams":200,"priceINR":799,"label":"200 GMS"}]'::jsonb, 'In stock (284 in stock)', 'https://greysoul.coffee/products/the-yellow-lot-grey-soul-coffee', 200, 'scraped'),
