  ('Grey Soul Coffee', 'Summer in Kodaikanal (Light Roast)', 'Grey Soul Coffee', 'India', 'Perumalmalai Hills, Kodaikanal', 'St. Joseph Estate', '4000+ feet', 'Catimor, Chandragiri, and SLN9', 'Sun-dried naturals using controlled dehydrator drying', 'Light', 'Mandarin brightness & rounded body that carries a lingering tropical fruit finish. Ripe strawberries with mandarin brightness, layered over gentle tropical fruit & soft cacao finish. Sweet, vibrant cup with bright acidity, a medium-heavy body & lingering sweetness. Harvest: 2026.', '[{"weightGrams":200,"priceINR":799,"label":"200 GMS"}]'::jsonb, 'Sold out', 'https://greysoul.coffee/products/kodaikanal-naturals', 200, 'scraped'),
